# 14. Network Troubleshooting

For a user reporting no Internet access, use a structured process.

```text
Check physical/Wi-Fi connection
        ↓
ipconfig /all
        ↓
Check IP address
        ↓
Ping default gateway
        ↓
Ping 8.8.8.8
        ↓
Ping google.com
        ↓
nslookup google.com
        ↓
Identify the likely problem
        ↓
Apply authorized fix
        ↓
Verify
        ↓
Document
```

### Interpretation

#### Cannot reach default gateway

Investigate:

* Local network
* Wi-Fi/Ethernet
* Network adapter
* Gateway configuration

#### 8.8.8.8 works but google.com fails

Investigate:

* DNS configuration
* DNS server availability
* Name resolution

#### Internet works but one application fails

Investigate:

* Application
* Firewall
* Port
* Authentication
* Permissions
* Application/server availability

