```

---

## 17. Authorization

Authorization determines what an authenticated user is allowed to access or perform.

Example:

```text
Authenticated User
        ↓
Security Group
        ↓
Finance Folder
        ↓
Authorized Access
```

### Key Difference

> **Authentication verifies who you are; authorization determines what you are allowed to access.**

