# 26. Help Desk Troubleshooting Methodology

Today's support workflow:

```text
1. Gather Information
        ↓
2. Understand Symptoms
        ↓
3. Identify Possible Causes
        ↓
4. Start With Basic Checks
        ↓
5. Investigate Evidence
        ↓
6. Apply Authorized Fix
        ↓
7. Verify With User
        ↓
8. Document
        ↓
9. Close or Escalate
```

### Important Principle

> **Do not guess and do not make unnecessary changes. Use evidence to identify the likely cause first.**

